        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c7361937-8740-52aa-a23e-c544c2dc28cb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Spider9, A123 Systems, Wanxiang Group, Wave Crest Energy Systems, Johnson Controls\n- People: Glynne Townsend, Dave Park, Dave Smith, Bill Beckman\n- Organizations: USABC\n- Topics: lithium-ion batteries, energy storage systems\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Spider9 was founded by Glynne Townsend, Dave Park, Dave Smith, and Bill Beckman.\n- Glynne Townsend was affiliated with A123 Systems when Spider9 was founded.\n- Dave Park was formerly Vice President of Production at Wave Crest Energy Systems before helping found Spider9.\n- Dave Smith was formerly chairman of USABC before helping found Spider9.\n- Bill Beckman was formerly Vice President of Finance at Johnson Controls before helping found Spider9.\n- A123 Systems, LLC is a wholly owned subsidiary of Wanxiang Group.\n- A123 Systems develops and manufactures advanced lithium-ion batteries based on lithium iron phosphate.\n- A123 Systems develops and manufactures energy storage systems for transportation and other commercial and industrial applications.",
